<tr>
<td class="col-md-3">Lineage Statement</td>
<td>This dataset includes 2 versions of the official ICOADS Release 3.0.0 dataset: 1) the 'Total' product (denoted by 'T' in the filename) which contains all duplicates and is used for verification and research purposes; and 2)'Final' R3.0.0, with duplicates removed, where all reports have been compared for matching dates, id's and elements observed and the best duplicate retained as the final report.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Processor</td>
<td><ul class="unstyled"><li>DOC/NOAA/NESDIS/NCEI &gt; National Centers for Environmental Information, NESDIS, NOAA, U.S. Department of Commerce</li></ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="col-md-3">Processing Steps</td>
<td><ul><li>Final Dataset after inclusion of new sources, qc and final validation.<br> Rationale: To provide the highest quality data set.</li></ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="col-md-3">Processing Documents</td>
<td><ul class="unstyled"><ul class="unstyled"><li>IMMA format Description<ul class="cite-url"><li>
<a href="https://icoads.noaa.gov/e-doc/imma/R3.0-imma1.pdf" target="_blank">IMMA format Description</a><br>NOAA ICOADS documentation describing the process and formatting of data.</li></ul>
</li></ul></ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="col-md-3">Source Datasets</td>
<td><ul class="unstyled"><li>International Comprehensive Ocean-Atmosphere Data Set (ICOADS)<ul class="cite-url">
<li>
<a href="https://icoads.noaa.gov/" target="_blank">International Comprehensive Ocean-Atmosphere Data Set (ICOADS)</a><br>Main NOAA website for ICOADS project.</li>
<li>Description of Source: Heterogenius mixture of marine platforms and data sources</li>
<li>Temporal extent used: 1662-10 to 2014-12</li>
<li>Spatial extent used:  N:90  S:-90  E:180  W:-180</li>
</ul>
</li></ul></td>
</tr>
</table>
